# Clock discipline at the edge of the crystal spec, and a gateway reboot
# starting a new timeline (epoch).
at 0.0  drift imu_gps 400
at 0.0  drift dashboard -400
at 0.0  drift stress 250
at 10.0 expect all sync_err_us < 50
at 10.0 expect all synced == 1

at 12.0 reboot gateway
at 16.0 expect all event:TIME_SYNCED >= 2
at 20.0 expect all sync_err_us < 50
at 20.0 expect gateway boot_count == 2
at 20.0 expect all state == RUN
end 20.0
